{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pulls/226","id":4832632280,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUcYs_s8AAAABIAwd2A","html_url":"https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pull/226","diff_url":"https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pull/226.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pull/226.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/issues/226","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pulls/226/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pulls/226/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/issues/226/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/statuses/44955a4bce6ccb2a5ac914fc03cd05a5aa220063","number":226,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Extract A1 scheduling store using the existing owned connection (#204)","user":{"login":"aaweaver-actuary","id":53792857,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzkyODU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53792857?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary","html_url":"https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem and resulting behavior\n\nImplements A1 under #204/#217: scheduling persistence now uses the five-capability `SchedulingReviewStore` protocol, immutable application facts, and an adapter borrowing the caller-owned PostgreSQL/SQLite connection. The adapter never manages transactions. The wrapper signature, response, FSRS results, source/history semantics, original clocks, seed maturity and existing follow-ups are preserved.\n\n`main.py`, command gateway, review commands, queue helpers and pure scheduler are unchanged. No public API, schema, receipt store or transaction manager changes. #220 retains queue ownership. **#224 remains separate and incomplete**; `review_commands → main._apply_review` remains.\n\n## Regression coverage and qualification\n\nNew regular fake-store/SQLite tests cover call order, explicit clocks, complete fresh/replay results, seeds and invalidated history, missing/archived cards, errors, infrastructure import isolation and owner rollback. Two native proofs cover logical/final receipt failure rollback, actual concurrent locks, identical/conflicting delivery, connection restart, uncertain-response replay and exactly-once history/queue effects. Existing expectations are unchanged. See `tests/REGRESSIONS.md` and `docs/architecture/ci-isolation/scheduling-store-a1.md`.\n\nInitial source: `3f7332399796366eb32f9fcb5e1b5c678a5b1562`.\nCurrent integrated base after #191 merged: `25363aa0bc7073646ff8a00b94857d4f3127f694`.\nCurrent head: `44955a4bce6ccb2a5ac914fc03cd05a5aa220063`.\n\nLocal macOS arm64 / CPython 3.14.8 / Node 26.10.0; native Docker PostgreSQL 18.6 / Redis 7 / product Python 3.12:\n- Pre-extraction characterization: 5 passed, 0.55s; original complete SQLite parity: 24 cases, 0.84s wall.\n- Affected Python selection: 218 passed, 61.08s; final guard/caller selection: 81 passed, 12.91s. Runner tests: 67 passed, 2.655s.\n- Focused native rollback/concurrency/continuation proofs: passed on `8200e096`, 31.22s wall.\n- `make ui-file FILE=post-review-progression.spec.ts`: 3 passed / 256.42s wall; `training-critical-path.spec.ts`: 1 passed / 128.38s; `phone-offline-training.spec.ts`: 15 passed / 74.29s.\n- First local `make docker-durability` failed before A1 in unchanged refresh-state recovery with a priority-source lock timeout. The isolated pinned-main case passed; cause is unproven. First focused native run failed a new absent-operation test expectation, corrected to the existing `unknown` response plus direct no-row assertion. Both failures are preserved and are not counted as passes.\n- [Draft FULL run](https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/actions/runs/38282616369): all planned execution/verification layers passed, including complete PostgreSQL durability and all browser shards. Head `8200e096`, base `3f733239`, captured integration `10994073fa5dcf885d807d9d2dc5b6a508a8cd36`. Quality/merge-gate rejected draft state as designed.\n\n#191 then merged. Its regression registry and A1 entries are both preserved; no A1 product conflict or dependency transplant. #146 remains separate. Fresh ready-state FULL qualification for the current head/base is required and will be recorded in a PR comment with exact integration SHA. Older passes do not qualify the new candidate.\n\nCommands, counts, logs, timing and provenance are preserved on [the dedicated evidence branch](https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/tree/codex/issue-204-scheduling-evidence/docs/architecture/ci-isolation/evidence-204); final qualification and cleanup updates will follow there and in #204.\n\n## Limits, rollback and cleanup\n\nNarrow persistence extraction has ordering/transaction risk; controlled unit cases do not prove PostgreSQL locking. Native cases plus complete CI cover those boundaries. No universal deadlock/performance claim. Revert the extraction commits to roll back; schemas, history, receipts and pending intents remain readable.\n\nOnly task-owned disposable resources were used. Live study and Agent A were untouched. Runner teardown has completed; final identifier verification and checkout preservation/removal follow CI. Pinned-main baseline checkout already removed after preservation, recovering 123036 KiB.\n\nCloses #204 upon qualified merge. References #217, #192, #220 and #224.\n","labels":[{"id":12610267999,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUcYs_s8AAAAC76FrXw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/aaweaver-actuary/tempo/labels/ci:full","name":"ci:full","description":"Run complete verification on a draft; development evidence does not qualify it for merging.","color":"19794b","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-12T17:08:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T17:37:27Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"76b66d0ed3bbb3b5c2c5fb9b6d8d952343826e91","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"aaweaver-actuary:codex/issue-204-scheduling-store","ref":"codex/issue-204-scheduling-store","repo":{"id":1371942142,"node_id":"R_kgDOUcYs_g","name":"tempo","full_name":"aaweaver-actuary/tempo","owner":{"login":"aaweaver-actuary","id":53792857,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUzNzkyODU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/53792857?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary","html_url":"https://github.com/aaweaver-actuary","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaweaver-actuary/repos","events_u